# kernel, platform generic-aarch64 or generic-x64
### The AMD (ATI) graphics cards of a PC or of an arm64 server or workstation, as modules: amdgpu and
### radeon for the older ones; dracut (-a drm) puts them into the initramfs with the firmware they
### name in their modinfo, which it takes from the /lib/firmware of the sysroot: linux-firmware first,
### or an initramfs of a first build comes out without it
CONF_FLAGS+=" -m DRM_AMDGPU -m DRM_RADEON"
PKG_DEPS+=" firmwares/linux-firmware"
